  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞“联谊咖啡厅”迷宫内……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}说起来，这里虽然叫“联谊”，\n却一点也不像呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}诶，不是吗！？\n不是要找命中注定的另一半吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}真正的联谊……更痛苦。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}那是学长你们在文化祭上办的\n联谊咖啡厅吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}别提了，我不想回忆……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}真正的是什么样的呢？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0D 01 03 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}真正的联谊呢，更讲究……\n男女之间的调情，\n还有恋爱的各种门道！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}真正的联谊呢，更讲究……\n男女之间的调芹菜肉馅，\n还有鲤鱼的各种蘸料！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:8:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}原来如此！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}嗯，完全不对！\n简单来说，就是男生和女生\n聊天、互相了解的聚会。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0C 01}聊天的聚会……\n……我想参加！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 02 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0D 01}……这样啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0112",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0B 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 08 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 01}那么，现在开始。\n请参赛者排好队。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 09 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0F 01}诶，难道是强制参加！？\n这可难办了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0C 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 15 01 02 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}提不起兴趣{F5 47 02 01 03 01 07 01 01 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:14:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}交给顺平了{F5 47 02 01 03 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:14:2",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}大家上吧！{F5 47 02 01 03 01 03 01 01 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0C 01 0F 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 10 01}啊，看你就不太习惯这种场面。\n算了，我教教你也不是不行。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0C 01 0F 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 11 01}诶，我？\n交给号称恋爱猎人的我，\n当然万无一失啦！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0C 01 0F 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 12 01}哦，你很有干劲嘛！\n既然队长大人下令，\n那就只能上了！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:18:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 0C 01 09 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 13 01}不过，我已经有小千鸟了啊。\n有女朋友还来参加联谊，\n实在不太好吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:18:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 14 01}但要是为了玲，\n我倒愿意出一份力！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:18:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 15 01}对吧？真田学长、荒垣学长！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:19:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_018",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 16 01}我？还是免了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:20:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0B 01 04 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 17 01}哎呀？\n忘了屋久岛的事了吗？\n搭讪比赛……你不是输了吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:20:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 18 01}男子汉的较量，输了就跑，\n这可不像真田学长啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:21:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 0B 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 19 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}你说什么！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:22:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0202",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0D 01 07 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1A 01}……好，这次我要赢回来。\n走吧，阿真！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:23:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_021",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 0B 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1B 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}喂……别把我扯进去！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_110.bf.json:24:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 01 01 04 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1C 01}那么，对面就由\n八十神高中的女生们来参加吧！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
